## Definition of done

Localhost is never a deliverable. Work is done when the deployed URL serves it and a
command proves it. If you cannot verify, say "unverified" — do not say "done".

## Anti-regression — DO NOT TOUCH

<The highest-value section in this file. Numbered, specific, each with its reason.
